We did it again💓My heart is full at my amazingly bold, brave &amp; committed staff
@UKYouth held our 2nd “A space to talk” #Allhands chat on #BLM
Led by staff, we explored what we’re learning, our role in supporting others &amp; the need to “get our own house in order” 🙌🏾 #YoungAndBlack https://t.co/2daRg1WuYg

David this is great. I’ve heard so many concerns and reflections that discussions on race and #BLM is not as “relevant” in predominantly white communities. Your leadership to counter that is to be applauded!👍🏾
